    "norm": "Provides pairs of {@code {discordianDate, equivalentIsoDate}} that represent the same day. The pairs span a wide range of years, month boundaries, leap years and St. Tib's Day (the leap day, written as month 0 / day 0 in the Discordian calendar)."
   },
